# Implementation Plan - Module 7: AI Assistant Module

Implement a high-fidelity, interactive **AI Assistant Hub** matching Stitch Screen ID `d95c80a8e7bc4a0f869e38207cddf725`. This module features real-time anomaly detection views, a policy chatbot with citation support, spend forecasting widgets, interactive configuration toggles, and an intelligence action log.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **AI Engine Config Toggles**: We will persist configuration states (Policy Assistant, Smart OCR, Real-time Anomaly, and Sensitivity Slider) in memory / Redis. Toggling them in the UI will trigger real-time updates to the backend.
> - **Spend Forecast Chart**: Visualizes actual monthly spends (aggregated from the DB) alongside forecast projections for future months with a styled SVG/bar layout.
> - **Rich Chat Citations**: The chatbot interface will render formatted policy citation boxes if a citation reference is returned in the API response.

